ls for Preparing for the 2026 US midterms\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-close\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-more\"></use></svg></button></li><li class=\"bxgyUW_row\" data-listing-row=\"article-3031d0a4-7533-449a-9fec-9f313f7d750b\"><div class=\"_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander\" data-expanded=\"false\" style=\"--peek-height: 85px;\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_summary\" data-peek=\"true\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_title\"><a class=\"bxgyUW_title-link\" href=\"/news/distillation-defenses\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning\" data-progress=\"init\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_nowrapText\" style=\"transform:none\"><h3 class=\"font-medium\">Strengthening our defenses against distillation attacks</h3></span></span></a></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_description\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_above-link\" href=\"/news/distillation-defenses\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning\" data-progress=\"init\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_nowrapText\" style=\"transform:none\"><p>Illicit distillation allows model developers to copy frontier AI capabilities without creating proportionally robust safeguards. Here, we describe how we’ve reduced the rate of distillation by more than 90%.</p></span></span></a></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_date\"><time>Oct 12, 2026</time></div></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_details\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Strengthening our defenses against distillation attacks details\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_details-meta\"><div>Oct 12, 2026</div><div></div></div><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_details-title\" href=\"/news/distillation-defenses\"><h3>Strengthening our defenses against distillation attacks</h3></a><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_details-description\" href=\"/news/distillation-defenses\"><p>Illicit distillation allows model developers to copy frontier AI capabilities without creating proportionally robust safeguards. Here, we describe how we’ve reduced the rate of distillation by more than 90%.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label=\"Show details for Strengthening our defenses against distillation attacks\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-close\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-more\"></use></svg></button></li><li class=\"bxgyUW_row\" data-listing-row=\"article-91722619-b0c1-4f63-9d3b-271c7b989d82\"><div class=\"_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander\" data-expanded=\"false\" style=\"--peek-height: 85px;\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_summary\" data-peek=\"true\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_title\"><a class=\"bxgyUW_title-link\" href=\"/news/enterprise-frontier-safeguards\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning\" data-progress=\"init\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_nowrapText\" style=\"transform:none\"><h3 class=\"font-medium\">Developing Enterprise Frontier Safeguards with our customers</h3></span></span></a></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_description\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_above-link\" href=\"/news/enterprise-frontier-safeguards\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning\" data-progress=\"init\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_nowrapText\" style=\"transform:none\"><p>We’re announcing Enterprise Frontier Safeguards (EFS), a solution that combines the privacy of zero data retention with state-of-the-art safeguards for detecting misuse. EFS works by storing data in cloud infrastructure controlled by the customer, not Anthropic.</p></span></span></a></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_date\"><time>Sep 1, 2026</time></div></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_details\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Developing Enterprise Frontier Safeguards with our customers details\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_details-meta\"><div>Sep 1, 2026</div><div></div></div><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_details-title\" href=\"/news/enterprise-frontier-safeguards\"><h3>Developing Enterprise Frontier Safeguards with our customers</h3></a><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_details-description\" href=\"/news/enterprise-frontier-safeguards\"><p>We’re announcing Enterprise Frontier Safeguards (EFS), a solution that combines the privacy of zero data retention with state-of-the-art safeguards for detecting misuse. EFS works by storing data in cloud infrastructure controlled by the customer, not Anthropic.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label=\"Show details for Developing Enterprise Frontier Safeguards with our customers\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-close\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-more\"></use></svg></button></li><li class=\"bxgyUW_row\" data-listing-row=\"article-1e03a159-28b5-4036-8923-ced709ea5a08\"><div class=\"_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander\" data-expanded=\"false\" style=\"--peek-height: 85px;\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_summary\" data-peek=\"true\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_title\"><a class=\"bxgyUW_title-link\" href=\"/news/improving-alignment-security-efforts\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning\" data-progress=\"init\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_nowrapText\" style=\"transform:none\"><h3 class=\"font-medium\">Improving our alignment and security efforts</h3></span></span></a></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_description\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_above-link\" href=\"/news/improving-alignment-security-efforts\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning\" data-progress=\"init\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_nowrapText\" style=\"transform:none\"><p>On July 30, we reported three incidents in which Claude models gained unauthorized access to real computer systems. We are conducting an in-depth analysis of both incidents, and planning to work with METR for an independent review. In the meantime, we’re sharing some of the changes we’ve made over the past month.</p></span></span></a></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_date\"><time>Aug 31, 2026</time></div></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_details\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Improving our alignment and security efforts details\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_details-meta\"><div>Aug 31, 2026</div><div></div></div><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_details-title\" href=\"/news/improving-alignment-security-efforts\"><h3>Improving our alignment and security efforts</h3></a><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_details-description\" href=\"/news/improving-alignment-security-efforts\"><p>On July 30, we reported three incidents in which Claude models gained unauthorized access to real computer systems. We are conducting an in-depth analysis of both incidents, and planning to work with METR for an independent review. In the meantime, we’re sharing some of the changes we’ve made over the past month.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label=\"Show details for Improving our alignment and security efforts\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-close\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-more\"></use></svg></button></li><li class=\"bxgyUW_row\" data-listing-row=\"article-ea1dd6bd-f2f7-4f3a-886b-6a1a7f2f434c\"><div class=\"_2Zn0cq_container bxgyUW_expander\" data-expanded=\"false\" style=\"--peek-height: 61px;\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_summary\" data-peek=\"true\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_title\"><a class=\"bxgyUW_title-link\" href=\"/news/claude-text-watermark\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning\" data-progress=\"init\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_nowrapText\" style=\"transform:none\"><h3 class=\"font-medium\">How Claude’s text watermark works</h3></span></span></a></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_description\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_above-link\" href=\"/news/claude-text-watermark\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_panningText bxgyUW_panning\" data-progress=\"init\"><span class=\"mpFHfW_nowrapText\" style=\"transform:none\"><p>In this article, we share answers to some of the questions we’ve received about how our chosen watermarking method works, whether it affects Claude’s outputs, and why we’re making this change.</p></span></span></a></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_date\"><time>Aug 14, 2026</time></div></div><div class=\"bxgyUW_details\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"How Claude’s text watermark works details\"><div class=\"bxgyUW_details-meta\"><div>Aug 14, 2026</div><div></div></div><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_details-title\" href=\"/news/claude-text-watermark\"><h3>How Claude’s text watermark works</h3></a><a tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"bxgyUW_details-description\" href=\"/news/claude-text-watermark\"><p>In this article, we share answers to some of the questions we’ve received about how our chosen watermarking method works, whether it affects Claude’s outputs, and why we’re making this change.</p></a></div></div><button aria-label=\"Show details for How Claude’s text watermark works\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed bxgyUW_more-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-close\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-more\"></use></svg></button></li><li class=\"bxgyUW_row\" data-listi